{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15946","headline":"凉州行 · 王建","name":"凉州行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凉州四边沙皓皓，汉家无人开旧道。\n边头州县尽胡兵，将军别筑防秋城。\n万里人家皆已没，年年旌节发西京。\n多来中国收妇女，一半生男爲汉语。\n蕃人旧日不耕犂，相学如今种禾黍。\n驱羊亦着锦爲衣，爲惜毡裘防鬬时。\n养蚕缫茧成匹帛，那堪绕帐作旌旗。\n城头山鸡鸣角角，洛阳家家学胡乐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15946.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15946","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}